<title>CANADA: Canrise to sell 2.25 mln special warrants.</title>
<headline>Canrise to sell 2.25 mln special warrants.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canrise Resources Ltd said on Monday it reached an agreement with underwriters for the sale by Canrise of 2,250,000 special share purchase warrants at C$7.00 per special warrant, for aggregate gross proceeds of C$15,750,000.</p>
<p>Canrise said proceeds from the sale will be used to partially fund the acquisition of certain properties and assets in the McLeod area of Alberta from Mobil Oil Canada, a unit of Mobil Corp.</p>
<p>The sale of the special warrants is expected to close January 28,1997, Canrise said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
